  "bodyText": "Contact\n\nNew to First Baptist Muncie?\n\nIf you are new to First Baptist Muncie and would like to find out more about the church, please fill out this virtual visitor’s card.\n\nNotify Us\n\nDo you need to share something with the church such as:\n\nBirth Announcement\n\nNotification of Death\n\nSpecial Birthday\n\nSpecial Anniversary\n\nEngagement/Marriage Announcement,\n\nRetirement\n\nNon-Emergency Hospital Admission / Surgical Procedure\n\nGraduation\n\nDecision of Faith\n\nPhone Number / Address Change?\n\nOther questions?\n\nCan't find the information you need or just want clarification? Contact the church office.\n\nChurch Office Hours\n(may change on holidays)\n\nMonday - Thursday | 9:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m. & 1:00 p.m. - 4:00 p.m.\n\nFriday | 9:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m.\n\nSundays | 9:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m. (Building open for Sunday School and Sunday Worship)\n\nFor Business, Billing, or Related Needs\n\n(765) 284-7749\n\noffice@fbcmuncie.org\n\nMailing Address\n\n309 East Adams Street, Muncie, IN 47305\n\nPastors’ Office Hours\n\nThe pastoral staff are in and out of the office throughout the week with various appointments, visitations, study, and meetings.\n\nThe Co-Pastors have set aside Tuesdays as office hours for those seeking meetings at the church. You can schedule a time in their office hours below.\n\nTuesday Office Hours | 9:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m. and 1:00 p.m - 5:00 p.m.\n\nJonathan Balmer\n\nKendall Ellis\n\nSchedule\n\n[Button] I’m new and want to learn more -> https://fbcmuncie.churchcenter.com/people/forms/159198\n\n[Button] Notify the church -> https://fbcmuncie.churchcenter.com/people/forms/159897",
